      "text": "frontend  dev-skycraft-swc-lb-frontend\nprotocol  TCP  8085 → 8085\nprobe     dev-skycraft-swc-lb-probe-world\npersist.  None — 5-tuple hash\nidle 4 min · TCP reset enabled",
